{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謝詞不錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "居士參此三不是話，因語\n及，師驀豎拳云：『者個喚作甚麼？』士擬議，師便掌，士遂禮拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謝詞不錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謝詞不錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "係五峰名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謝辭不錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是日鍾翁到會"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "表自臨終纏綿，寄中云：衲僧撩起便\n行。表自遂呵呵三笑而逝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諱白"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別號髻珠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諱之遴"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諱端伯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諱元竑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甲申夏發"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諱建策"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諱勳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附來書法師相見機緣語句載堯峰錄內"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因僧請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "詳載《宗門統要》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隱元琦請"}
